WEBVTT

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.470
This place!

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:32.690
Nonoha?

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.280
What are...

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.320
Fr..Freecell!

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.440
Kaito, let's do a puzzle.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.290
What is it?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.320
Weren't you going to save me?

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.000
I can see it, Kaito.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.770
Our puzzle time!

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.970
What was that just now?

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.050
Don't tell me...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.920
Lost

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.050
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.970
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.890
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.230
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:08.940
Found

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:13.190
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:17.650
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.490
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.580
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:26.910
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:28.830
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.540
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.880
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.090
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:37.460
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.930
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.640
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.470
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.350
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.480
It's now or never

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.560
That is what they say

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.650
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:56.320
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.480
That is what they say

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.650
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.160
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.370
That is what they say

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.790
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.960
The Puzzle of Fools, Once Again

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:22.470
The POG has been investigating
this "Klondike" name.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.590
You learn anything?

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.960
Sure enough, just the name.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.910
Jeez, the POG ain't no use!

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.310
Then, do your own investigating!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:36.500
I will report next.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.830
Ana's big sister, Eve Gram...

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.950
and Pinochle...

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.950
I've examined the remains of their Rings,
and the result...

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.780
Sure enough, they're both Replica Rings.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.690
H..Hold on a minute.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.790
Wasn't it the Orpheus Order themselves

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.710
who said their Rings were real?

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:05.370
Yeah, and that they're
true Phi-Brain children.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:09.720
At any rate, their Rings were replicas,
no doubt about it.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.050
And the others' too?

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:17.980
Freecell said he made his
fake Ring into a real one.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.170
A Replica into a real one?

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:22.530
Is that possible?

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:25.540
It shouldn't be, even theoretically.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:31.360
What's more, he said his mom dyin'
wasn't Kaito's fault, huh?

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.960
He said that he loved his mother,

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.560
but also that he hated her, right?

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.050
Kaito?

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.970
Doubt, have you seen Melancholy?

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.680
I can't find her anywhere.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:10.620
No.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.830
Oh, that child...

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.270
I wonder what's going on?

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:22.380
Herbert was beaten, and
Freecell has disappeared.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:26.140
We aren't receiving any new orders.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.600
I care nothing for that.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.510
I wait for word from Mr. Klondike.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:35.850
That is all.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.490
We remain unable to locate Freecell.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:53.810
His using the Replica Ring to awaken to
his Phi-Brain potential

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.500
was not in our calculations.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.270
There is no outcome that
the calculations do not produce.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.340
This is nothing more than your mistake.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.250
Do you understand?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.220
I'm very sorry.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:12.010
Nothing in this world fails
to proceed by my calculations.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:16.010
This mistake must be quickly addressed,

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.270
Mr. Whist.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.540
Understood, Mr. Klondike.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.710
This cute place suits me more

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:29.150
than some moldy old
castle, don't you think?

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:32.280
Yes, it suits you well.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:35.170
Hey, so, what's gonna happen now?

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.930
Even I do not know.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:40.470
Huh? That's boring!

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.200
Not knowing how something will

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:46.260
develop makes it more
interesting, Miss Melancholy.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.400
Really?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:58.100
No matter how the chips fall,
there is always enjoyment.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.960
Where did Kaito go to?

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.780
Did he go home ahead of me?

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.890
A "memento of Mama," huh?

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:32.300
Gammon, what's going on?

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:35.570
That's my line, Q-taro!

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.640
What the hell are you hidin'?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.140
Wh..What are you talking about?

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.650
Quit actin' dumb.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:54.030
Last night, Kaito's
brainwaves were active.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.920
You're still monitorin' him?!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.200
And?

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.840
The activation pattern

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:05.430
matched that when he approached

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:08.170
Phi-Brain potential and saw the future.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:12.930
At first, I thought maybe
the sensors were broken, but...

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.810
He trashed the Orpheus Order's armlet.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:17.680
This ain't possible, right?

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.700
I thought that too.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:21.680
But...

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:42.050
That wasn't a dream.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.420
That sensation...

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.270
I'm sure of it.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:49.980
What I saw was the future.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.590
Also, that Ring's glow...

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.780
Freecell...

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.100
Is Freecell really...

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.670
Him!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.880
Bastard, what the hell have you done?!

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:28.630
It seems Mr. Freecell is not with you.

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.350
Freecell?

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.630
What are you talking about?

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.560
I came here thinking perhaps he had.

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.580
I shall explore other avenues.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.280
Goodbye.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.290
Wait!
Goodbye.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:39.390
Yes?

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:45.390
Freecell's and the other's Rings
are replicas, aren't they?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.080
Get in, if you want.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:59.410
As you said, Mr. Freecell and the others
own Replica Rings.

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:03.390
They are samples for collecting
data, nothing more.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.520
Thanks to their games with you,

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.170
we acquired some splendid data.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.850
We're grateful for your cooperation.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.670
Why are you looking for Freecell?

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:20.180
Mr. Freecell has begun to awaken to
his Phi-Brain potential.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.840
That something like
that could happen with

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.370
a Replica Ring was
outside our assumptions.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.150
We must collect all data.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:47.960
If you encounter Mr. Freecell,
please tell him I am looking for him.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:52.600
Sure enough, Freecell's
becoming a Phi-Brain!

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.460
In which case...

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.460
But you can't beat me as you are now.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.730
After all, I'm...

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.800
Just wait, Freecell.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.170
I'll do my best.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:26.490
What did you say?!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:28.700
Rook...

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.570
Let me challenge a Puzzle of Fools.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:46.010
Kaito ain't here?!

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.660
Yeah, I went to get him this morning
and he was gone.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.960
I thought he'd come to
school early, but...

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.160
He wasn't here.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:55.980
Yeah...

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.530
I wonder what happened?

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.990
Come to think of it, Kaito asked me to

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.990
contact Master Rook yesterday.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.280
What the heck for?

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.970
I didn't get any specifics.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:11.540
He just said, "Tell him
I want to meet him."

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.100
Could that have something to do with it?

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:32.820
So, inside here...

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:35.370
Yes, there is a puzzle.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:40.160
The Puzzle of Fools that
Master Rook made to lead you

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.610
to your Phi-Brain potential.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.050
You're really going to
challenge it, Kaito?

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.080
Yeah!

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.070
I, for one, object.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.700
Please reconsider.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.390
I gotta get stronger,

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:02.840
to battle Freecell and then save him.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:03.980
That guy...

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:09.430
He friggin' said he didn't care
about the promise, or his mom.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:14.310
That's how deeply he's been
swallowed up by the Ring?

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.030
I...

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:17.790
I gotta stop him.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:21.570
But the way I am now, I
got no chance of winning.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:26.100
Because he's begun to awaken to
his Phi-Brain potential?

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:30.460
That's why you will challenge
a Puzzle of Fools,

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:31.330
so that you too can?

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.010
Forget it.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.260
I won't be no Phi-Brain.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.210
I'll get stronger without doin' that.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.950
Master Rook, this is dangerous.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.130
We must stop him.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:45.150
Kaito's feelings won't change.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:47.700
Neither will mine.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.310
Puzzle time...

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:57.990
Let's begin!

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.290
This is...

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.330
a maze?

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.090
An hourglass...

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:33.350
I have to find the route in a set time
and make it to the exit?

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.360
Anyway, I've just gotta try!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:54.550
This thing...

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.280
Pitfalls in front of the stone faces?

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.880
I've gotta go forward
avoiding these things, huh?

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.400
It's no good, I can't go any farther.

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:27.920
If the stone faces have
pitfalls in front of 'em,

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:29.900
I'm boxed in all eight ways.

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.910
That leaves this one,
which faces to the rear.

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:38.410
It moves!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:46.880
The stone face can move the
space of one floor panel.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:51.470
Maybe each can only be moved once.

00:15:55.910 --> 00:16:00.230
I get it, you gotta move the
stone faces to make your path!

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:10.870
All right!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.740
What is it, Cube?

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:18.740
Th..This is...

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.890
Kaito is solving a puzzle.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:27.350
What'd you say?!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.060
Don't tell me he's been ambushed
by the Orpheus Order!

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:32.580
Cube!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.900
Hold on, I'll pull up a map.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:41.070
Huh? No way!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:41.810
What?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:44.020
You got an idea or somethin'?
What?

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.530
A Puzzle of Fools?!

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.620
Yes, what's more, one
that Master Rook made.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.000
So, Rook is with him?

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.250
His thought speed is increasing rapidly.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.430
What's Kaito doing in a Puzzle of Fools?

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:06.190
I, Ana, think the two
of them will be okay.

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:07.040
Ana...

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.550
Let's believe in them,
in Kaito and Rook.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.050
What?!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:24.370
Dammit, yet another trap, huh?!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.160
Even now, I can't forgive myself.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.320
Master Rook...

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:38.820
Not for making such a
cold-hearted puzzle.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.280
That was...

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:43.260
You were swallowed up by the Armlet.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:45.580
It's not your fault, Master Rook.

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:48.190
Yes, swallowed up by the Armlet,

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:51.090
I tried to awaken my
Phi-Brain potential.

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:54.860
Which is precisely why I don't want

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.150
anyone to make the same mistake.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:01.060
I don't want anyone
made to feel that way.

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.850
Not Kaito, and not myself.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:47.020
This is the end!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.020
His thought speed is
going back to normal.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.210
Looks like he solved the puzzle, huh?

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.330
How's Kaito?

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:20.800
He's fine, no injuries.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.050
Thank goodness.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:51.120
"F?"

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:52.870
No doubt about it.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.630
It's Freecell!

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.560
You're saying that he solved it first?

00:19:58.320 --> 00:19:59.750
This Puzzle of Fools?

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:04.090
Rook, guide me to another
Puzzle of Fools,

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.150
a more extreme one!

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:08.650
I made this Puzzle of Fools

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.940
when you were still wearing
the Armlet of Orpheus.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.650
So the heck what?

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:17.510
You solved it without relying
on the Armlet's power.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:20.900
That's how much stronger you've become.

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:30.050
But I still have to do it.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:34.670
To stop him, I've gotta
get even stronger!

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:39.670
That's right, you have to do it.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:41.770
I believe.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:43.630
I believe you can do it.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:49.430
You freed my mind from the
Armlet's spell, Kaito.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:51.910
Rook...

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:57.690
This time I'll be with you, Kaito.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.230
Mr. Freecell...

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.270
You thought if you kept watch on Kaito

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.980
you'd find me, didn't you?

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:41.910
Bingo!

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:47.730
My psyche synchronized with the Ring.

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:50.200
And so, I awakened.

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:52.800
The moment I awakened...

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.210
I could see so many things.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.520
Many things?

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:00.570
Yes.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:04.270
That's why I waited for you there today.

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.970
I can see everything.

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:10.080
About you,

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:11.720
and what you know.

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:14.480
And the future that...

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:17.370
you and I want.

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.050
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:44.940
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.370
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.160
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.230
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:07.670
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:13.220
Kitto daijoubu, kimi o mamorunda
It's sure to be all right, I'll protect you

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.040
Machigai da to shitemo tomarenai
Even if it's wrong, it can't be stopped

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.650
Seikai ka nante wakaranai
I don't know if it's the right answer

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.660
Donna toki demo original ni
No matter the situation

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:27.400
Step o fumidashiteku
I'll take those first steps, originally

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.770
Dramatic ni, mawaru sekai de
On this spinning world, I'm searching, dramatically

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:34.430
Kiwameita wonder sagashiteru
For wonders that sparkle

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.430
Boku, shijou saikou no tabi o tsuzukeyou
Me, I'll keep going on the greatest journey in history

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:42.740
Image shite shiawase na mirai e
To the happy future I imagined

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:46.060
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.380
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:52.800
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.260
(Mirai e)
(To the future)

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:05.040
Sorry, Mizerka, I kept you waiting.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:06.420
You're late, Doubt!

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:07.610
Our preparations are behind schedule!

00:24:07.610 --> 00:24:09.190
Sorry, sorry.

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:12.560
Still, you're so cutesy
when you're angry.

00:24:12.560 --> 00:24:15.310
Oh, you big fool, I'm not listening!

00:24:16.830 --> 00:24:17.970
Bada-bing.

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:21.320
Next time, "The Sad Clown"

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:26.670
The Sad Clown

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:22.800
What's wrong, Doubt?

00:24:23.770 --> 00:24:24.620
It was a dream?

00:24:24.620 --> 00:24:26.910
Okay, let's go to Root Gakuen.
